sieve-filter-v1
; The built-in window-v2, written in the token form: window-data-v1 with trailing padding, so the
; last page of a text passes, its last word cut by the end of the text as any page's may be. It must
; judge and count exactly as window-v2 does, with the same dictionary.
id        window-data
version   2
author    Edward James Gordon (written with Claude)
origin    ai-directed
lines     text
symbols   lower27
describe  Could be cut from running English, and a unit may end in SPACE padding (window-v2, as a plugin).
param     dictionary  dict  default  the word list (a registered dictionary)

tokens    separator " "
edges     cut
padding   trailing
set       word  dict:{dictionary}
end
